.ua

so that's how a valid answer to {.i xu do klama} can be {go'i}.  I always
kind of wondered what happened to the {xu} when a person says {go'i}.
Although.... how is it that the {xu} doesn't get included when you have
A:  {do klama ti xu ta}
B:  {go'i}
?

